  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5704.04 Procedure for School Transportation Provider Criminal History Record Check Request",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5704.04 Procedure for School Transportation Provider Criminal History Record Check Request.\n\n(a) Notwithstanding any rule to the contrary, a school transportation provider seeking to authorize the release of his or her criminal history record to a superintendent or chief executive officer for the purposes of RSA 189:13-a, shall submit to the division the following:\n\n(1) A fully executed DSSP 434 “Contracted School Transportation Providers Criminal History Record Release Form”, effective 8/1/18;\n\n(2) A complete set of fingerprints pursuant to Saf-C 5705; and\n\n(3) All applicable fees as set forth in (b) below.\n\n(b) In addition to the fees set forth in Saf-C 5703.10(c), Saf-C 5703.13, and Saf-C 5705.06(b), a $5.00 fee shall be assessed for each listed school superintendent or chief executive officer on DSSP 434.\n\nSource. #12606, eff 8-17-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5700.html"
